  "remarks": "Sources agree: intro C A, C A, C A G F, then D; verse all D; chorus A, Bm, D. On the record the intro changes fall before the beat and D is pushed into the end of the F bar; the chart spaces them evenly. Four bars of D after Bm follows one source; the fade is written as three passes. Bar counts fit 121 BPM and 3:07.",
